        ":question/problem": "Calculate $AB$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nComplete the product.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>$5$</td><td>$11$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$6$</td><td>$-4$</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$-1$</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$3$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Multiply each row of $A$ by each column of $B$, adding the three pairwise products.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{11} &= (-3)\\cdot0+0\\cdot(-1)+(-1)\\cdot3 = -3 \\\\ c_{12} &= (-3)\\cdot(-1)+0\\cdot3+(-1)\\cdot(-2) = 5 \\\\ c_{13} &= (-3)\\cdot(-3)+0\\cdot3+(-1)\\cdot(-2) = 11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{21} &= 0\\cdot0+0\\cdot(-1)+2\\cdot3 = 6 \\\\ c_{22} &= 0\\cdot(-1)+0\\cdot3+2\\cdot(-2) = -4 \\\\ c_{23} &= 0\\cdot(-3)+0\\cdot3+2\\cdot(-2) = -4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{31} &= 0\\cdot0+1\\cdot(-1)+0\\cdot3 = -1 \\\\ c_{32} &= 0\\cdot(-1)+1\\cdot3+0\\cdot(-2) = 3 \\\\ c_{33} &= 0\\cdot(-3)+1\\cdot3+0\\cdot(-2) = 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 5 & 11 \\\\ 6 & -4 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n",
