      "question": {
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $AB$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nComplete the product.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>$5$</td><td>$-6$</td><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$-4$</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$4$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$0$</td><td>$-3$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Multiply each row of $A$ by each column of $B$, adding the three pairwise products.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{11} &= 0\\cdot2+(-1)\\cdot1+2\\cdot3 = 5 \\\\ c_{12} &= 0\\cdot3+(-1)\\cdot0+2\\cdot(-3) = -6 \\\\ c_{13} &= 0\\cdot(-2)+(-1)\\cdot3+2\\cdot2 = 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{21} &= (-2)\\cdot2+0\\cdot1+0\\cdot3 = -4 \\\\ c_{22} &= (-2)\\cdot3+0\\cdot0+0\\cdot(-3) = -6 \\\\ c_{23} &= (-2)\\cdot(-2)+0\\cdot3+0\\cdot2 = 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{31} &= 0\\cdot2+(-1)\\cdot1+0\\cdot3 = -1 \\\\ c_{32} &= 0\\cdot3+(-1)\\cdot0+0\\cdot(-3) = 0 \\\\ c_{33} &= 0\\cdot(-2)+(-1)\\cdot3+0\\cdot2 = -3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -6 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -6 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n",
